183
00:10:36,310 --> 00:10:37,810
Yeah, you feel keyed up.

184
00:10:37,870 --> 00:10:38,590
Exactly.

185
00:10:38,960 --> 00:10:41,920
And that just fuels the emotional, often aggressive response.

186
00:10:42,890 --> 00:10:48,060
